    "detailed_description": "Step onto the pitch in <i>Bang Average Football</i>, the ultimate football game for fans of the not-so-beautiful game!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393770/extras/7b777e9a3770d79af9bd479d743bf438.poster.avif?t=1750890252\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393770/extras/7b777e9a3770d79af9bd479d743bf438.webm?t=1750890252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393770/extras/7b777e9a3770d79af9bd479d743bf438.mp4?t=1750890252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Featuring fast-paced gameplay and easy-to-learn mechanics, <i>Bang Average Football</i> is the perfect game for players of all skill levels. Choose from a range of men's and women's teams to play with, and experience the thrill of the game in fast-paced, action-packed matches. Trounce your friends in local multiplayer or go for glory in the single player Story mode. With simple controls and addictive gameplay, <i>Bang Average Football</i> is the ultimate football experience!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393770/extras/d96e7984f02c755c1945bb4759766947.poster.avif?t=1750890252\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393770/extras/d96e7984f02c755c1945bb4759766947.webm?t=1750890252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393770/extras/d96e7984f02c755c1945bb4759766947.mp4?t=1750890252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story Mode</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Join a washed-up, rock bottom football club as player-manager, and guide them through the ranks to the coveted top division!<br></li><li> Learn how to manage your team, make strategic transfers, upgrade the town stadium, secure sponsorships, and engage with fans to maximise the club's all-important Reputation.<br></li><li> Visit other towns and clubs around the country between matches and take on challenges along the way to improve your abilities and become a player worthy of being a National Champion!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393770/extras/660122ae614034a83571fe53b7621d2d.poster.avif?t=1750890252\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393770/extras/660122ae614034a83571fe53b7621d2d.webm?t=1750890252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393770/extras/660122ae614034a83571fe53b7621d2d.mp4?t=1750890252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Local multiplayer for 1-4 players.<br></li><li> 25 teams and 1,000+ male and female players.<br></li><li> Rich team and character creation and customisation.<br></li><li> Deep tactical customisation and control, including custom formations and team instructions.<br></li><li> Accessibility settings, including high contrast modes for colour blind players.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Step onto the pitch in <i>Bang Average Football</i>, the ultimate football game for fans of the not-so-beautiful game!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393770/extras/7b777e9a3770d79af9bd479d743bf438.poster.avif?t=1750890252\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393770/extras/7b777e9a3770d79af9bd479d743bf438.webm?t=1750890252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393770/extras/7b777e9a3770d79af9bd479d743bf438.mp4?t=1750890252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Featuring fast-paced gameplay and easy-to-learn mechanics, <i>Bang Average Football</i> is the perfect game for players of all skill levels. Choose from a range of men's and women's teams to play with, and experience the thrill of the game in fast-paced, action-packed matches. Trounce your friends in local multiplayer or go for glory in the single player Story mode. With simple controls and addictive gameplay, <i>Bang Average Football</i> is the ultimate football experience!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393770/extras/d96e7984f02c755c1945bb4759766947.poster.avif?t=1750890252\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393770/extras/d96e7984f02c755c1945bb4759766947.webm?t=1750890252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393770/extras/d96e7984f02c755c1945bb4759766947.mp4?t=1750890252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story Mode</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Join a washed-up, rock bottom football club as player-manager, and guide them through the ranks to the coveted top division!<br></li><li> Learn how to manage your team, make strategic transfers, upgrade the town stadium, secure sponsorships, and engage with fans to maximise the club's all-important Reputation.<br></li><li> Visit other towns and clubs around the country between matches and take on challenges along the way to improve your abilities and become a player worthy of being a National Champion!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393770/extras/660122ae614034a83571fe53b7621d2d.poster.avif?t=1750890252\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393770/extras/660122ae614034a83571fe53b7621d2d.webm?t=1750890252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393770/extras/660122ae614034a83571fe53b7621d2d.mp4?t=1750890252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Local multiplayer for 1-4 players.<br></li><li> 25 teams and 1,000+ male and female players.<br></li><li> Rich team and character creation and customisation.<br></li><li> Deep tactical customisation and control, including custom formations and team instructions.<br></li><li> Accessibility settings, including high contrast modes for colour blind players.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Experience the thrill of the beautiful game in Bang Average Football - the fast-paced, addictive, easy-to-learn football game for 1-4 players! Play against your friends for footballing glory in multiplayer, or turn a hopeless club into national champions as player-manager in Story mode!",
